WEBVTT

00:12:29.121 --> 00:12:31.954
of being a part of something that is so big,

00:12:31.954 --> 00:12:34.704
you can hardly get your head around it,

00:12:34.704 --> 00:12:37.579
and the promise that it just might change the world.

00:12:37.579 --> 00:12:39.996
Thank you.

00:12:39.996 --> 00:12:42.954
(Applause)